          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Seth P. Waxman, on behalf of the Petitioner, petitioner argues that this case is an exceptional instance of racial discrimination in jury selection, comparable to the hypothetical described in\u202fHernandez\u202fv.\u202fNew\u202fYork, and should serve as a model for evaluating Batson challenges."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
