            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg posed a question about a scenario where jurors of different races receive qualitatively and quantitatively different questioning, highlighting the core issue of whether such disparity violates Batson."
      }
    ],
