  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Waxman",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b0ba4bd7ea48-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Eight of the 15 African American jurors were given the graphic script, representing 53\u202fpercent, while only three of the 49 white jurors received the script."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b0ba4bd7ea48-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to State, the State allegedly shuffled the jury each week to move African American jurors from the front of the venire to the back."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Bunn",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b0ba4bd7ea48-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Bunn, the record lacks the questionnaires of the white jurors; only the African American jurors\u2019 questionnaires were presented."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b0ba4bd7ea48-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Defense counsel objected to the striking of every African American juror except two."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (Waxman)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b0ba4bd7ea48eb193b13cfc0f739b5141cc00d9a86f54bb30437442a8beaad96",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b0ba4bd7ea48-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Waxman), the graphic script was given at the beginning of voir dire based on the questionnaires, while the \u201cminimum punishment ploy\u201d was introduced at the very end, after all evidence had been presented."
      }
    ],
